    "title": "Your first ping",
    "topic": "Getting started",
    "brief": "Two PCs share a switch but have no IP addresses yet. Give each one an address in **192.168.1.0/24**, then ping between them and watch the exchange in the Events tab.\n\nSelect a PC and set its address in the Inspector.",
